id: alternate-sight-fourth-effect
name: Alternate Sight
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: alternate-sight
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Alternate Sight's fourth effect, as a Maneuver: a Perception Clash at an Opponent - won, your next attack at them this Round Strike 1(T), Wound 2(T).
text: >
  (4)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, target an Opponent who is not Hidden from you. Make a Skill Clash (Perception vs Perception/Stealth) against them. If you win, increase the Strike and Wound Rolls of your next Attacking Maneuver made against that Opponent during this Combat Round by 1(T) and 2(T) respectively.

---

# Not at one Hidden from you; the Clash on its card - won, the mark, spent by your next attack at them this Round (chat.mjs).
[on used]
alternateSight();
